          <groundspeak:finder id="7338377">j0ckser</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP215 Edmonton (112 Avenue)

Posted: N 53° 33.716 W 113° 27.113

My GPSr: N 53° 33.715 W 113° 27.113&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GeoGuider and I met up with Team WillowZilla today to do some brass caps. We brought along a bag full of tools. Tim brought along a long screw driver that BVPete left behind at a brass cap somewhere along the way. For this cap, the metal detector and a look at some context photos from CoolCat21 did the trick. The brush did the cleaning. Cap is rather banged up - some numbers readable. Thanks for the cap outforthehunt.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
